  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.987,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "虽然讲现在立春已经有一个多礼拜了哈，但是我们桂林呢都是冷春的，是不是？",
      "score": 0.1465,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1214,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1141,
        "sc_delta": 0.0073,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.199,
        "seg_cer": 0.094,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "虽然讲现在立春已经有一个多礼拜了啊，但是我们桂林的都是冷春的是不是啊？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 4.987,
      "end": 7.15,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这样子呢，可能还要冷那个过半两个月。",
      "score": 0.6328,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.3197,
        "sc_logprob": -0.3181,
        "sc_delta": 0.0016,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.822,
        "seg_cer": 0.312,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.25,
        "phon_examples": "子/至",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "甚至呢，可能还要冷得个过把两个月。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 7.175,
      "end": 10.586,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "所以现在有些热水袋啊、暖宝宝啊、电热毯啊，",
      "score": 0.0254,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0546,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0525,
        "sc_delta": 0.002,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.056,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "所以现在有些热水袋啊、暖宝宝啊、电毯啊。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 10.586,
      "end": 12.931,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "都还是大家取暖的一个法宝。",
      "score": 0.0762,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0015,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0019,
        "sc_delta": -0.0004,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.167,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "豆腐还是大家取暖的一个法宝。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 12.985,
      "end": 16.646,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "但是在用这些取暖产品的时候呢，你只要一不注意呢，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0147,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0139,
        "sc_delta": 0.0008,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "但是在用这些取暖产品的时候呢，你只要一不注意呢。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 16.65,
      "end": 19.49,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "就会给低温烫伤，没错吧？",
      "score": 0.6114,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.3764,
        "sc_logprob": -0.3606,
        "sc_delta": 0.0158,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.2,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "就会被低温烫伤，没有错吧？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 19.568,
      "end": 23.063,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "就是喊低温烫伤。虽然讲了温度不高啊，",
      "score": 0.5225,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.343,
        "sc_logprob": -0.4109,
        "sc_delta": -0.0679,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.895,
        "seg_cer": 0.125,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "就是它低温烫伤，虽然讲的温度不高啊。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 23.063,
      "end": 25.328,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "但是呢，就给你在不知不觉当中呢，",
      "score": 0.1053,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0048,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0127,
        "sc_delta": -0.0079,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.143,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "嘞",
        "text_free": "但是嘞，就给你在不知不觉当中嘞。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 25.328,
      "end": 28.86,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "就把你烫到了。那啷子来预防这种低温烫伤呢？",
      "score": 0.0241,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0169,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0165,
        "sc_delta": 0.0004,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.053,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "就把你烂到了，那啷子来预防这种低温烫伤呢？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 29.186,
      "end": 32.651,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "什么喊就是低温烫伤呢？低温烫伤啊，",
      "score": 0.6724,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.8616,
        "sc_logprob": -0.7045,
        "sc_delta": 0.1571,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.333,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "斯麦罕州是低温烫伤的。低温烫伤啊。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 32.651,
      "end": 39.32,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "就指身体长时间接触高于四十五度的低热物体造成的慢性烫伤。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0006,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0007,
        "sc_delta": -0.0001,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "就指身体长时间接触高于四十五度的低热物体，造成的慢性烫伤。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 39.411,
      "end": 43.217,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "啷子会那么多低温烫伤呢？因为冬天里面气温低，",
      "score": 0.1305,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0679,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0714,
        "sc_delta": -0.0035,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.031,
        "seg_cer": 0.25,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "汤子会啷多低温汤上呢？因为冬天里面气温低。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 43.357,
      "end": 48.351,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "人体的皮肤敏感度就下降，大家呢就容易因为保暖产品使用不当，",
      "score": 0.0169,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0161,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0143,
        "sc_delta": 0.0018,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.037,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "硬体的皮肤敏感度就下降，大家呢就容易因为保暖产品使用不当。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 48.351,
      "end": 51.824,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "所以造成的低温烫伤。那都有哪些症状呢？",
      "score": 0.0269,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0096,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0067,
        "sc_delta": 0.0028,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.059,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "所造成的低温烫伤，那都有哪些症状呢？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 52.269,
      "end": 56.112,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "低温烫伤导致创面一般疼痛感是不明显的，",
      "score": 0.0655,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0825,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0863,
        "sc_delta": -0.0038,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.077,
        "seg_cer": 0.056,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "低温烫伤导致创面啊，一般疼痛感是不明显的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 56.112,
      "end": 59.905,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "但皮肤呢会出现红肿、水泡或者是发白。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0132,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0121,
        "sc_delta": 0.0011,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "但皮肤呢，会出现红肿、水泡或者是发白。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 60.085,
      "end": 62.796,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "哪些人群容易爱低温烫伤呢？",
